,"v":{"b":false}}],"id":850},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-C16-a-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: It would be nice if something about this turned out to be simple."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":851},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-16-1"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: I wish I could give you something more useful."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":852},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-16-2"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: I really do."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":853},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-16-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: But I don't want to make up answers just because I don't like having questions."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":854},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-16-5"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: There's something else I should say."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":855},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-16-6"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: I know you've ended up in a really strange situation."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":856},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-16-7"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: And it's mostly because of me."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":857},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-16-8"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: You didn't ask to get involved."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":858},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-16-9"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: I know that."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":859},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-16-11"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: I don't actually expect you to find Daniel."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":860},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-16-12"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: That's not fair to put on you."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":861},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-16-13"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: I just thought..."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":862},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-16-14"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: Maybe there's something we're missing."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":863},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-16-15"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: Something someone outside all of this might notice."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":864},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-C17-a-1"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: Really?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":865},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-C17-a-2"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: Thank you."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":866},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-C17-a-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: I mean it."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":867},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-C17-a-4"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: Even just talking things through might help."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":868},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-17-1"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: Just promise me one thing."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":869},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-17-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: If something feels wrong, don't ignore it."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":870},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-17-4"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: And don't put yourself in danger over any of this."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":871},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-17-5"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: I don't want someone else getting hurt."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":872},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-17-7"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: Wow."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":873},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-17-8"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: I've been talking for ages."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":874},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-17-9"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: Sorry."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":875},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S03-AFTER-17-10"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Sophie: You probably didn'