nation fields: [REDACTED IN PUBLIC PREVIEW]\n...\nVERIFIED 24 NOV 2019 15:20\n[page edge outside crop]"],["P",{},"Earlier cropped extract, not an authenticated original article or complete historical file. The comparison concerns the report’s linked record section."]],["ARTICLE",{},["H3",{},"Page retained by Nora"],["PRE",{},"Retained page description / text-only copy:\n\nNORTH QUAY EVACUATION / BUS 4\nRecord GH-NQ-BUS4-2019-11-23 / v1\n23 NOV 2019\nResidents: 12 / identifying fields [REDACTED]\nEscort: JUNE ELLIS\nDestination fields: [REDACTED IN PUBLIC PREVIEW]\n...\nVERIFIED 24 NOV 2019 15:20\n[page edge outside crop]\n\nImage pixels and independent custody record unavailable."],["P",{},"Nora describes keeping this copy. Original status NOT ESTABLISHED. Matching text is not independent authentication."]],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-choice"},"Record retained-page comparison"]],[[3,23]],[[3,32]],[[3,34]],[[3,65]],[[3,141]]]]],[[92,145]]]]],[[98,59]],[[98,60]]]],"viewport":{"width":320,"height":720},"timestamp":96891.177,"wallTime":1800002030360,"collectionTime":2,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
